# Falsifiability (round-3 H-02): a plain-string p95 vs numeric budget cannot be
# lexically green — non-numeric datatype is a violation under the isNumeric guard.
@prefix ciops: <https://oip.law/ontology/ci-ops#> .
ciops:g-y ciops:usedCostEstimate ciops:ce-str ; ciops:hasBudget ciops:b-y .
ciops:ce-str ciops:p95Ms "1000" .
ciops:b-y ciops:softP95BudgetMs 900 .
